{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-rrxd-uik4-r7n3-7f77","published":"2026-11-11T18:56:38Z","modified":"2026-11-16T02:34:02.531880727Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-33165"],"summary":"libde265 is an open source implementation of the h.265 video codec. Prior to version 1.0.17, a crafted HEVC bitstream…","details":"libde265 is an open source implementation of the h.265 video codec. Prior to version 1.0.17, a crafted HEVC bitstream causes an out-of-bounds heap write confirmed by AddressSanitizer. The trigger is a stale ctb_info.log2unitSize after an SPS change where PicWidthInCtbsY and PicHeightInCtbsY stay constant but Log2CtbSizeY changes, causing set_SliceHeaderIndex to index past the allocated image metadata array and write 2 bytes past the end of a heap allocation. This issue has been patched in version 1.0.17.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libde265","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.23","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/libde265"},"versions":["1.0.16-r0","1.1.1-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-rrxd-uik4-r7n3-7f77.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libde265","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg:deb/dhi/libde265"},"versions":["1.0.15-1+deb13u1+dhi0","1.0.15-1+deb13u1+dhi1","1.0.15-1+deb13u2+dhi0","1.0.15-1+deb13u2+dhi1","1.0.15-1+deb13u2+dhi2"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-rrxd-uik4-r7n3-7f77.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-rrxd-uik4-r7n3-7f77"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-33165"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/security/advisories/GHSA-653q-9f73-8hvg"},{"type":"FIX","url":"https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/commit/c7891e412106130b83f8e8ea8b7f907e9449b658"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/releases/tag/v1.0.1